# Handoffs and reports

Handoffs need: task_id, sender, recipient, objective, findings, files, decisions, constraints, expected_deliverable, acceptance_criteria, unresolved_questions, verification_evidence.

Reports need: summary, files changed, commands actually run, QA verdict, risks, decisions needed.

Do not write fictional agent chat logs.
